{"schemaVersion":1,"courseNo":17,"lessonId":"sky/island-algorithm/17-stack","authored":true,"slides":[{"layout":"title","emoji":"📚","title":"スタックとキュー","subtitle":"入れる・出すの順番が、\n2 種類ある。","blocks":[]},{"emoji":"🏠","title":"スタックのたとえ","blocks":[{"t":"analogy","icon":"📚","real":"本の積み重ね。\n上に載せて、上から取る。","tech":"**スタック**＝\n==後入れ先出し（LIFO）==。"}]},{"emoji":"➕","title":"入れる操作","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"追加は **push**","sub":"いちばん上に載せる"}]},{"emoji":"➖","title":"出す操作","blocks":[{"t":"big","text":"取出しは **pop**","sub":"いちばん上を取る"}]},{"emoji":"🐾","title":"A→B→C を push","blocks":[{"t":"trace","vars":["操作","上から見た中身"],"rows":[["push A","A"],["push B","B A"],["push C","C B A"]],"notes":["底が A","上が B","上が ==C=="]}]},{"emoji":"🚪","title":"キューのたとえ","blocks":[{"t":"analogy","icon":"🚪","real":"受付の行列。\n先に並んだ人が先に通る。","tech":"**キュー**＝\n==先入れ先出し（FIFO）==。"}]},{"emoji":"📥","title":"キューの操作名","blocks":[{"t":"compare","left":{"icon":"📥","title":"入れる","items":["**enqueue**"]},"right":{"icon":"📤","title":"出す","items":["**dequeue**"]},"vs":"↔"}]},{"emoji":"🆚","title":"取り出し順のちがい","blocks":[{"t":"compare","left":{"icon":"📚","title":"スタック","items":["==LIFO==","最後に入れたものから"]},"right":{"icon":"🚪","title":"キュー","items":["==FIFO==","最初に入れたものから"]},"vs":"VS"}]},{"emoji":"🎬","title":"LIFO を追う","blocks":[{"t":"anim","caption":"▶ push 3 回 → pop","frames":[{"visual":"[ ]","text":"スタックが空"},{"visual":"[ A ]","text":"push A → 底に A"},{"visual":"[ B, A ]","text":"push B → B が上"},{"visual":"[ C, B, A ]","text":"push C → C が一番上"},{"visual":"[ B, A ] ← C が出る","text":"pop → ==最後に入れた C が先に出る（LIFO）=="}]}]},{"emoji":"💥","title":"あふれと空","blocks":[{"t":"compare","left":{"title":"オーバーフロー","items":["満杯なのに追加"]},"right":{"title":"アンダーフロー","items":["空なのに取出し"]},"vs":"⚠"}]},{"emoji":"📝","title":"試験ではここ","blocks":[{"t":"callout","kind":"exam","text":"スタック＝**LIFO**。\nキュー＝**FIFO**。操作名もセットで。"}]},{"emoji":"✅","title":"確認①","blocks":[{"t":"check","q":"X, Y の順に enqueue。最初の dequeue で出るのは？","choices":["X","Y","どちらでも","空エラー"],"answer":0,"explain":"